{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"num_turns":66,"total_cost_usd":9.448616,"usage":{"input_tokens":94,"output_tokens":20699},"result":"The Add Patient form now sits centred on the page, and PR https://github.com/accuhealthevelyn/inpulse/pull/5550 is open against `develop`. It is not merged and auto-merge is not enabled. I also commented on issue #5526 with a link to the PR.\n\n**Cause:** the container holding the breadcrumb, heading and form card was capped at 900px wide but had no auto margin, so it stayed pinned to the left. The success screen next to it already centres itself this way.\n\n**Fix:**\n- **Page:** in `src/frontend/inpulse-web/src/pages/admission/index.tsx:517`, the class list goes from `flex max-w-[900px] flex-col gap-4` to `mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[900px] flex-col gap-4`.\n- **Prototype:** `docs/prototypes/design-source/src/39-admission.jsx:67` gets `margin: '0 auto', width: '100%'`. The same one-line change is copied into `inpulse-app.jsx` and the two standalone HTML files.\n- **Regression test:** new `PageAdmission.centered.test.tsx`. It failed on the unfixed code (`expect(element).toHaveClass(\"mx-auto\")`, received `flex max-w-[900px] flex-col gap-4`) and passes after the fix.\n\n**Checks:** format, lint (`--max-warnings 0`), `tsc --noEmit` and format:check all exit 0, and all 162 admission tests pass. To get lint and `tsc` to run I had to match CI's setup: a bigger Node memory limit (the default ran out of memory) and a root `npm ci` (without it `tsc` couldn't find `@playwright/test`).\n\n**Not verified in a browser:** the pod had no running app. The unit test checks the centring classes on the rendered page, not where the form actually lands on screen. Someone should open the Add Patient page, and the prototype's Patient Admission screen, in a window wider than 900px to confirm.\n\n**Other screens the issue mentioned:**\n- The success screen and the Internal Admission Form wizard were already centred, so I left them alone.\n- I did not check the onboarding promote, new case or enterprise setup forms. That was on purpose, to keep this change small. They're listed as unchecked in the PR's symptom list.\n\n```\n docs/prototypes/InPulse Standalone.html            |  2 +-\n .../design-source/InPulse-standalone.html          |  2 +-\n docs/prototypes/design-source/inpulse-app.jsx      |  2 +-\n docs/prototypes/design-source/src/39-admission.jsx |  2 +-\n .../__tests__/PageAdmission.centered.test.tsx      | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n .../inpulse-web/src/pages/admission/index.tsx      |  2 +-\n 6 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)\n```","terminal_reason":"completed","stop_reason":"end_turn"}
